sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Client<br/>with certificate
    participant AS as Authorization Server
    participant API as Resource Server API
    participant Attacker

    Client->>AS: Token request over mTLS<br/>client proves certificate possession
    AS->>Client: Certificate-bound access token
    Client->>API: API request over mTLS<br/>token + same certificate
    API->>API: Validate token and certificate binding
    API->>Client: Protected response
    Attacker->>Attacker: Steals access token only
    Attacker->>API: Tries replay without matching certificate
    API->>Attacker: Rejects request
